      "low opening called the male child’s older sisters 언니들 rather than 누나들.",
      "off wordplay translated the bee as 봉 and reversed the imperative 生意気言うな into 건방지다고 말해라.",
      "low wordplay retained a short repeated parenthetical phrase 반의어의 약어.",
      "medium wordplay translated restraint-related shame as 교수형의 치욕, adding a hanging/execution meaning absent from the source.",
      "Corrected-order xhigh wordplay removed the former long duplicated paragraph and retained previously missing nouns, but mistranslations/awkward phrasings remained.",
      "medium afterword was generally smoother and correctly rendered the stay at the friend’s home and psychiatric-hospital reference; this does not establish a consistent quality advantage across all samples."
